# Prefer existing libraries

Before writing a custom component for a common UI pattern (lightbox,
carousel, date picker, notifications), look at Mantine and other packages
we already use.

- Check https://mantine.dev for a maintained component
- Add the matching `@mantine/*` package rather than rebuilding it
  (for example `@mantine/lightbox` instead of a `Modal` plus an `Image`)
